WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.620
Father... Mother...

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.040
For now... this is farewell!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.500
Cut!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.500
That was explosively awesome!

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.550
You flatter me.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.640
Here is the next script.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.300
Thank you.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>I believe the next episode is when the super idol of my dreams makes his first appearance.</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.690
D-D-Does this say...

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.820
Subaru-kyun?!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.820
I'm on cloud nine!

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.910
Looks like the next episode's going to be great as well...

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.350
Ako-chan!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.520
Good morning. I'm looking forward to today.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.310
Me too! It's been forever since we've acted together.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.400
I can't contain my excitement!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.780
I feel the same.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.450
So, do you have an understanding of the story?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.860
Of course!

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.200
Mermaid Idol.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.250
The little mermaid Marissa you're playing pines for a human super idol.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:12.130
She turns into a human and works to become an idol on the surface.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.380
There's a huge fanbase for your drama.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.760
Well, I suppose that's a fine summary.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:21.260
And that super idol just so happens to be me.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.760
<i>S-S-S...Subaru-kyun!</i>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.220
Let's work hard together.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.730
You're playing Marissa's mentor idol, right?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.770
Yep, my role is to support her as she makes her way up.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:37.610
And Kanata here is the president of our agency.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.440
That looks good on you.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.150
I know.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.910
Hey! It's about time to start rolling!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.700
Oh, okay!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.420
A solo live in three days? {I'm not against one-man something}{one-man live wa daiseikou // atama no naka wa shoujo manga}

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:56.170
That's too sudden... I couldn't possibly!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.420
It appears I misjudged you.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.680
A greenhorn like you should just go back to the sea!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.680
It hurts...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.430
Is that all the strength you can muster?! {nice Mizuki ref}

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.940
How arduous the path to idolhood is...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:18.190
If only I had known, I would have stayed a mermaid!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.610
Cut!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.820
Okay, we're clear!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:28.740
Your acting struck me right in the heart, Ako-chan!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.540
Did you expect otherwise?

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:35.330
Man, your skills have only shot up since you joined S4.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.130
Thank you very much.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.050
<i>It's time for my scene with Subaru-kyun at last!</i>

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.720
<i>Now to show him my acting prowess!</i>

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.350
Ako-chan?

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:58.020
What's the matter? Why did you call me here?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.900
Cut! That's not the right line!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.950
What's the matter? Why did you call me here?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.080
Achoo!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.870
Cut!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.800
What's wrong? Why did you call me here?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:21.960
You see...

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.680
Cut! Ako-chan, that's not how real people walk!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.930
What's wrong? Why did you call me here?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.140
You see, there is something I must tell you.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.450
Cut! Ako-chan, watch your expression!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:52.990
What happened? Just relax and act like you always do.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.080
I'm sorry!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.250
Ever since I lived in the sea...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.250
I...

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.300
I've always...

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.300
Always?

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.970
I'm too embarrassed to go on!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.310
Cut!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.150
That's enough! We're wrapping up for today!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.150
Good work, everyone.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.660
If I cannot even say such a simple line, 
I don't deserve to be in S4.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.790
I agree.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:39.040
If being next to Subaru is enough to disrupt your acting,

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.790
maybe you're not cut out to be an actress.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.880
You don't understand a young lady's heart!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:56.140
Honestly, what gives him the right to lecture me like that?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.650
I cannot stand this world any longer. I must return home.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.190
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:08.110
I never had the makings of an idol.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.780
<i>Did I just overhear something awful?</i>

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.910
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:22.330
And then... "I must return to my homeland beneath the sea."

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.220
Yeah, what's up, Nii-san?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.680
Huh?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.300
What?! Ako's leaving?!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.770
I didn't hear anything about that!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.690
Wait, Yume!

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:44.980
Sorry! I'm in a hurry, so get back to me later!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.700
Ako-chan, sorry to keep you!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.740
You're late! I was starting to worry—

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.120
Yo, sorry it took so long.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.200
We made it.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.750
Great, we're all here now.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.630
Let's get a move on.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:14.140
You're asking the impossible! How could I possibly practice with Subaru-kyun?

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:17.140
Don't worry. I'm here for you.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.350
Let's start by getting you comfortable with Subaru-kun.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.440
Ako-chan, hurry up!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.070
What are those four doing together?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.450
Something's definitely up.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.950
{=21}Crepes

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.950
{=20}Crepes

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.580
<i>First I need to get comfortable with Subaru-kyun.</i>

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.460
<i>Stay calm, don't get flustered...</i>

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.300
By the way, where are we practicing?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.760
Shouldn't we have booked a studio?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.220
That's not our only goal today.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.260
We need to get closer.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.970
Closer?

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.150
How adorable! Mind if we stop and look?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.060
Girls really do like that stuff.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:12.150
Y-Yes, we certainly do.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.530
What are they talking about?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.790
I know!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:26.210
Wasn't there a scene where Marissa reminisces about her past after seeing pearls?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.580
Wanna run through it?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.540
Huh, right here?

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.880
Oh yeah, how'd rehearsal go the other day?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.090
<i>Doing it in front of Subaru-kyun is embarrassing, but...</i>

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:35.470
Good. According to my analysis, we got through 123 lines. {I cannot hear the end of this. Netflix would've had every line in the CCs}

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.300
<i>If I can't, he'll definitely mock me again.</i>

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.300
Wow, that's pretty far. {???}{do these lines really need to be subbed}{whatever it's good enough}

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.090
Yeah.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.100
I-I'll do it.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:46.640
This warmth is ever so familiar...

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:51.860
Enveloped in a fluffy pearl pillow and a blanket of coral,

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.610
those afternoon naps in my bed of shells...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.070
If only I could return to those days!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:02.490
Amazing! I could see Marissa's magnificent castle so clearly.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:03.580
Right?

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.290
Yeah. That's our princess!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.220
Excuse me!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.300
What were they talking about just now?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.640
That cat-eared girl seems to be a princess.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.270
Princess?

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:30.230
Her house is full of huge pearls and 
expensive things, and she wants to go back there.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.190
What?!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.570
Have you heard anything about that?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.650
Not even a little!

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.110
But that girl with the ribbon said so too.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.860
Yume did?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:44.290
It's true, Ako's elegance isn't something you'd find in an ordinary girl.

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.410
But that doesn't mean she has to quit Aikatsu and go home.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:51.330
Thinking about it now, I don't know anything about Ako's family.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.260
There's no point in wasting time here.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.140
We have to go and talk to her directly.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.430
Right.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.730
Wow, could it be?

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.900
Are you two in love?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.500
Look, swan boats!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.000
Let's all ride in one.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.630
You never cease to act like a child.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.050
Who cares? Live in the moment.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:43.510
All set? Let's go!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.310
We missed them!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.600
There aren't any swan boats left.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.030
It's so nice out here.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.780
Y-Yes...

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:05.120
Should we practice the ocean scene? The one with you and me.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:11.210
The one where she finds out your true identity as an attendant to the Sea King?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.080
Sounds good. Go for it.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.040
Okay, I think I will.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.800
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.300
What's with this? We're not going anywhere.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.970
Rola, let me row.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.470
You ready?

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.810
Yeah...

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:37.190
M-Mahiru, you're going too fast!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.820
I believe you have already realized, 
but my former appearance was but a guise.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:49.200
Under your father's orders, 
I have come to escort you back.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:50.910
What was that?

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.210
I can't hear them clearly.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:57.670
I once considered abandoning my dream to become an idol.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.710
Yet in the end, I...

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:03.420
Your entourage is fast approaching. Please make your decision.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.720
I am a princess.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.850
The luxury of freedom is not allowed to me.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.720
Forgive me, everyone.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.100
I will quit being an idol!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.900
So it was true?

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.560
I won't accept it!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.360
S-Sorry!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.320
You okay?

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.700
I'm sorry!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.420
Hey, calm down!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.380
I've finally caught my breath.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.340
That's what I should be saying!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.840
You're probably thirsty. 
Want me to grab something?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.640
No, I'm...

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.350
It's Ako-chan!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.180
What's this, a date?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.850
I-It is nothing of the sort!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:03.440
Eh, but... you're making the same face Caroline did.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.240
It says "I love-love you!"{maybe "I like you-like you"}{if it wasn't the ep title and the theme, I'd consider it}

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.070
L-L-Love?!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.200
Hanazono Kirara, you know-nothing!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.290
Ah! Ako-chan, wait up!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.710
Ako?!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.710
What's with Mahiru making me come here just to ditch me?

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.920
She's not answering my texts either.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.550
Guess I should head back.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.140
I'm sorry, that's my...

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.230
Koharu-chan?!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.480
It's nice to see you again.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.400
Come on, where did she run off to?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.070
Seriously...

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.620
You don't understand a young lady's heart!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.210
I've returned, Asahi-senpai.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.420
Koharu-chan...

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.630
It's Koharu-chan!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.130
Relax, I used the blunt edge. {of her hand sword, like Kenshin}

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:12.390
Koharu, are you all right?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.640
Y-Yeah...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.600
She wasn't this way.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.600
Let's try that direction next. Come on!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.480
Yeah!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:25.400
There's no time to waste! We have to talk to Ako!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.610
Um...

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.990
There was never any hope to begin with.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.420
How could I ever be able to maintain my composure in front of Subaru-kyun?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.960
If being next to Subaru is enough to disrupt your acting,

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.500
maybe you're not cut out to be an actress.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.560
You may have been right.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.480
I don't understand a girl's heart, and I probably never will.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.810
But there's one thing I know for sure.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.740
Hold it right there!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.120
Don't say you'll quit being an idol!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:18.450
I can't imagine what it would be like without you!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.460
We all love you, Ako.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.710
Wh-Where is this coming from?

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.880
Oh, there she is!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.380
Wait, Mahiru-chan and Rola?

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.010
What are you doing here?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.090
What do you mean, what?!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:37.180
If you knew, why didn't you tell us?

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.180
Huh? About what?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.180
Stop trying to hide it!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.850
Yeah, be honest with us!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.690
The feeling of love isn't anything to be ashamed of.

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.730
Seriously, what are you talking about?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.690
In fact, it's the most important thing.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.530
It was all just for the drama?{this line could become into a meme or something I guess}

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.450
Yeah.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.200
What a relief...

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.710
You should learn to be more honest too, greenhorn.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.420
Hey!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.890
I think I'll be able to do it now.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:23.100
Please join me in practicing my scene with Subaru-kyun!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:40.200
Ever since I lived in the sea, I've always loved you.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:46.420
I will not give up on you, nor on becoming an idol.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.580
I vow upon my sea!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.960
Cut! Okay!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.010
That was perfect!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.180
Thank you.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.720
You were absolutely dazzling, Ako-chan!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.020
All that's left is our performance.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:07.270
Yeah! I'm go happy we get to sing together for the drama!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.110
Let's blow our viewers away.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:17.400
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.660
Saotome Ako, making a dazzling entrance!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.000
Great job!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.340
You too!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.590
I need to go pick up something I left on set.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.010
Hey, you know.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.850
That was the best you've ever been.

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.850
I-I knew that already! You didn't have to tell me!

00:23:56.120 --> 00:24:00.160
The strawberry-themed cute Fresh Strawberry Coord.

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:03.920
The white frills give the image of whipped cream and add extra cuteness!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:08.800
All of the strawberries adorning the dress make it feel like a fruit party!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.720
Spice Chord is in your hands, Sakuraba!

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:15.930
Yay! That really gets me going!

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:16.720
A felicitai—

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:18.680
However, it comes with a condition.

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.020
With a going my way!

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.400
Become the first-star idol!
